## Architecture Checklist
- [ ] ADR exists for significant decisions
- [ ] C4 diagrams are up to date
- [ ] API contracts are documented
- [ ] Observability is planned
- [ ] Security considerations addressed
- [ ] Scalability strategy defined
- [ ] DR plan documented
